* `.OPTIONS ACFREQPAR`: the AC FREQUENCIES are split across MPI ranks.
* Each rank factorizes the same replicated (G, C) at the operating point and
* the phasors are exchanged in batches, so the answer is bit-identical to a
* serial run — only the work distribution changes.
.OPTIONS ACFREQPAR
V1 in 0 DC 0 AC 1
L1 in out 1e-3
R1 out 0 1
.AC DEC 10 100 1e6
.END